{
  "key": 54330,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueFlintRoom_Text_FlintIntroPart1",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo, Trainer!\r",
        "You had me counting the days on my\n",
        "fingers waiting for you to come.\r",
        "I heard from Volkner what you \n",
        "did in Sunyshore.\r",
        "You managed to light a fire in that\n",
        "guy’s heart again.\r",
        "How could you not expect me to look\n",
        "forward to seeing you in battle?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hé, Dresseur!\r",
        "Je compte les jours depuis que \n",
        "j’ai su que tu allais venir.\r",
        "Le récit de tes exploits contre \n",
        "Tanguy est arrivé jusqu’ici.\r",
        "Réussir à raviver la flamme de ce vieux \n",
        "Tanguy... Plutôt bien joué!\r",
        "Tu imagines à quel point \n",
        "j’étais impatient de t’affronter?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueFlintRoom_Text_FlintIntroPart2",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re facing a Fire-type Pokémon\n",
        "user with me.\r",
        "Let Flint see how hot your spirit\n",
        "burns!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Prépare-toi à affronter des \n",
        "Pokémon de type Feu.\r",
        "Montre-moi si la flamme \n",
        "du combat brûle en toi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueFlintRoom_Text_FlintDefeat",
      "en_US": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...Whew...\n",
        "...Burnt right down to cinders..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Waouh... Que dire...\n",
        "Tu m’as réduit en cendres..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueFlintRoom_Text_FlintPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...Keep going..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Continue comme ça, Dresseur..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueFlintRoom_Text_FlintGameCompletedIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I was waiting for you, challenger!\r",
        "Flint, the master of the Fire type,\n",
        "is up next!\r",
        "Battles are clashes of the burning\n",
        "spirit of Pokémon.\r",
        "Battles aren’t about appearances\n",
        "or what’s weak or strong.\r",
        "It all comes down to whether the\n",
        "combatants can burn hot or not.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je t’attendais, Dresseur!\r",
        "Je suis Adrien, maître des \n",
        "Pokémon de type Feu!\r",
        "Les Pokémon ont toujours une flamme \n",
        "au fond des yeux quand ils combattent.\r",
        "Ce qui compte alors, ce n’est pas de \n",
        "savoir qui est fort ou qui est faible,\r",
        "mais d’être capable d’empêcher\n",
        "cette flamme de s’éteindre!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueFlintRoom_Text_FlintGameCompletedDefeat",
      "en_US": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...Whew...\n",
        "...Burnt right down to cinders..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Waouh... Que dire...\n",
        "Tu m’as réduit en cendres..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueFlintRoom_Text_FlintGameCompletedPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...Keep going...\r",
        "I know your spirit burns hot.\n",
        "Your whole team does."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Continue comme ça, Dresseur...\r",
        "Je sais que la flamme qui brûle en toi \n",
        "n’est pas près de s’éteindre."
      ]
    }
